  "question": {
    "text": "The major product obtained in the photo catalysed bromination of 2-methylbutane is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n1-bromo-2-methylbutane\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n1-bromo-3-methylbutane\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n2-bromo-3-methylbutane\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n2-bromo-2-methylbutane",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The order of substitution in different alkanes is\n$$\n3^{\\circ}>2^{\\circ}>1^{\\circ}\n$$\nThus the bromination of 2-methyl butane mainly gives 2-Bromo-2 - methyl butane\n<img src=\"assets\\st0132_37ebf176e6bb.png\"><br>"
  }
}